      "en": "The two angels came to Sodom at evening. Lot sat in the gate of Sodom. Lot saw them, and rose up to meet them. He bowed himself with his face to the earth,",
      "ko": "날이 저물 때에 그 두 천사가 소돔에 이르니 마침 롯이 소돔 성문에 앉았다가 그들을 보고 일어나 영접하고 땅에 엎드리어 절하여",
      "source_text_hash": "65448c2fb692eaac4e4baf8c392e2ead326f8c054e469405ae41bd99b2fe93d4",
      "translation_text_hash": "dcc47a552c8c81d1d7de6760a0960089554bf4cde53773b5e3fe1a150d07bf23",
