      "en": "They called to Lot, and said to him, “Where are the men who came in to you this night? Bring them out to us, that we may have sex with them.”",
      "ko": "롯을 부르고 그에게 이르되 이 저녁에 네게 온 사람이 어디 있느냐 이끌어내라 우리가 그들을 상관하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "d31ed18793ec31c12ebfe17b994582c62c622088830b753914a9b5e5a8e55457",
      "translation_text_hash": "c4af8b689884cda08b15c4eb4f26ac8c5d6f9cc26cc7d01084b00f0037110789",
