      "en": "Lot went out to them through the door, and shut the door after himself.",
      "ko": "롯이 문밖의 무리에게로 나가서 뒤로 문을 닫고",
      "source_text_hash": "cf216c79628f7753bb0bf716e963d1e12e58405d7852b98da68d2edd4373cb90",
