      "en": "He said, “Please, my brothers, don’t act so wickedly.",
      "ko": "이르되 청하노니 내 형제들아 이런 악을 행치 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "a049ba82745bd9d0f47c4f33c4265a4685c73773c0b823725aa9e5910683ceb1",
      "translation_text_hash": "17cb4eac195fa5794d358c4053ecb49941ea01add9ea6d8b14c55cce1a27f164",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이르되 청하노니 내 형제들아 이런 악을 행치 말라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "17cb4eac195fa5794d358c4053ecb49941ea01add9ea6d8b14c55cce1a27f164"
      ]
