      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "But he lingered; and the men grabbed his hand, his wife’s hand, and his two daughters’ hands, the LORD being merciful to him; and they took him out, and set him outside of the city.",
      "ko": "그러나 롯이 지체하매 그 사람들이 롯의 손과 그 아내의 손과 두 딸의 손을 잡아 인도하여 성밖에 두니 여호와께서 그에게 인자를 더하심이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "925a0199ebe746929ad4e19fba369319bd68d78b2c61a3d7e5bf2f010a8419cd",
      "translation_text_hash": "cde090578fe3a40c60902e49f03724693aaa26ee168d9b6e7d57c95ac5606f49",
