      "en": "It came to pass, when they had taken them out, that he said, “Escape for your life! Don’t look behind you, and don’t stay anywhere in the plain. Escape to the mountains, lest you be consumed!”",
      "ko": "그 사람들이 그들을 밖으로 이끌어낸 후에 이르되 도망하여 생명을 보존하라 돌아보거나 들에 머무르거나 하지 말고 산으로 도망하여 멸망함을 면하라",
      "source_text_hash": "6c0897586eac2c6fb243adaafb3f7ab49482b50c247947db3887119a4d8b08eb",
      "translation_text_hash": "45a5a36245944c5b508269dd8cf78dbd90c06bc9e3f84b62276fb3dbf5472a5f",
